en the Backlash [Music] Begins.  European textile merchants were losing so much money.  They demanded a ban on cotton made by Hudsons and Pegans.  Most of Europe bans chins.  Selling Indian chins could even land you in prison.  But the fashion was too irresistible.  Smuggling Continued for Decades."}}